			"notes": "The first public release of Not Enough Lapis for Minecraft 26.2 and Fabric.\n\n## Features\n\n- 200 unique enchantments\n- Three tiers of lapis armor, tools, weapons, spears, and elytra\n- New functional and decorative lapis blocks\n- Lapis Generator, Lapis Beacon, and Lapis Hopper\n- Lapis Slime and Necromancer Ally\n- Abandoned lapis mines with custom loot\n- Additional lapis ore generation\n- New recipes and advancements\n- English and Russian localization\n- Optional Traveler's Backpack integration\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Minecraft 26.2\n- Fabric Loader 0.19.3 or newer\n- Fabric API\n- Java 25\n\nTraveler's Backpack is optional."
